WEBVTT

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.630
Welcome back, everyone!

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.530
Huh?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:47.020
It's been really hot lately, Grandma.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.870
My First Talk About Memories

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.970
What's this?

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.840
Oww...

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:59.760
I'm sorry, Haruka-san!

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:02.890
Huh?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.900
Her butt is... her chest is...!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.890
Please let go of me!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.930
No.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.090
Let. Go. Of. Me!

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.760
Restrain yourself a bit, will you?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.830
But!

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.330
Don't point at people with your chopsticks.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.850
Fine.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.760
I think she touched my chest, too.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:40.740
I mean it was such a rare treat!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.860
And that butt... and her chest...

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.420
Oww!

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:53.630
At least Haruka acted as a cushion,
so you didn't hurt yourself.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.610
Oh yeah.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:01.160
I'm sorry for never thanking
you for saving me.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:03.970
Kana-chan!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.890
Kana-chan shouldn't be
the one apologizing.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.330
Jeez. What a joke.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.360
That's not why she did it.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.230
Kana-chan's nice, that's all.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.680
Yume-san...

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.550
Sorry, Yuuki.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.150
I'll pet you as well.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:39.400
What did you climb that tree for anyway?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.830
Oh. It was so hot and Bunta was up there.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.900
Wait, what?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.320
My grandmother told me that

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.020
cats know best how to find the cool places.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.040
I see.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.630
I know them too!

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.510
Marimo-chan told me!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.070
And Marimo-chan is...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.870
[Marimo = algae ball that
grows in northern areas]

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.870
She's from Hokkaido, so
I call her Marimo-chan.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.690
What I meant is,

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.040
who is she?

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:14.690
Well, Marimo-neesan is... well, she's...

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:16.820
She lived here until last year.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:18.420
Well, actually...

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.500
She's the worst employee in
Fuushin Gazette history.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:29.360
The worst... employee? Ever?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.930
That's right.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.170
So then, that means...

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:43.760
She had her newspaper bitten
by dogs and had them rip?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.940
Yup.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.710
She misread names and delivered
papers to the wrong place?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.910
Oh, that happened almost every day.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.370
She got lost on her route and made
the deliveries too late...

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.170
You don't know how many times I had to
go apologize because of complaints.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.290
And then, she probably got home
late from her deliveries,

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.680
was frazzled because she didn't have enough
time to prepare a proper breakfast,

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.130
and confused the canned fish
with Bunta's cat food...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.530
What?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.850
Actually, a lot of times, she couldn't
even come home at all,

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.220
so we would have to go pick her up.

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:21.440
I'm glad, at least I can make
it back home by myself!

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:27.590
But you always seemed to like having
Marimo-chan around, Chief.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:29.140
What?!

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:31.420
I didn't like it one bit!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.730
Well, even though you often complained,

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.520
you were quite attached to her.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.800
You were?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.140
You gotta be kidding me.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.580
Why would I like such a
troublesome person?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:48.010
Oh it's that thing where the clumsier
someone is, the cuter they are.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.900
That's ridiculous.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.770
I'm taking a break.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:06.620
I think I made her angry.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:08.500
Don't worry about her.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.500
She just doesn't want to admit it.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:14.430
I just remembered.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:15.480
What?

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:20.480
Remember that day last spring,
when we had that big snow?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.910
Oh yeah.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.860
I remember, I remember!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.310
Big snow?

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.040
Oh, you mean that cold snap we had,
the coldest in eighteen years?

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:32.560
Yeah. That was the day that...

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.080
Ah man.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.750
I fell over with my bike
in the middle of town.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.340
I hope the papers were all right.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:52.400
Well, the papers were fine... more or less.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:57.370
Is it Marimo-neesan again?

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:01.620
And you made her take a cell phone, right?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.030
Yeah, I made her hang it from her neck.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.230
Oh man.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.600
Hello, Neesan?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:15.180
Oh, Haruka, did something happen?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.230
There's not enough...

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.590
Not enough what?

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:18.560
The morning edition?

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.890
Or the sports-page?

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.350
There's not enough girl love!

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:27.730
Please give me love, LOVE!

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:34.740
Let's try to calm down, Chief.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.570
Chief?

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:46.270
Are you going to pick Marimo-neesan up?

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:48.230
Yeah.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.140
Hold on, why don't I go?

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:55.060
It's rough out there in the
snow. Dangerous too.

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.520
I'll be fine.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.890
No, I'll go today!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.030
Marimo-neesan might call
here at some point,

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:06.850
so somebody should stay
here to take her call.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.300
Fine then.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.620
Just let me take care of it.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.800
Hey Yume, where are you?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.970
Near Tenjin-san's.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.010
Bingo!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.190
Can you do me a favor?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:31.750
Huh?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.170
Okay, got it.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.640
I'll tell Yuuki about it.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.260
And now...

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.620
let's ask Haruka for help as well.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:53.200
Please give me love, LOVE!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.180
That would be more trouble.
Let's skip that.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.720
Damn it!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.570
Is this Marimo-neesan's?

00:10:58.140 --> 00:10:59.430
No way...

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:15.930
Did Marimo-san fall into the river?

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.710
That's what you would think, right?

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:22.750
I know I told Chief to leave it to me,

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.560
but I still called her without thinking.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:29.160
I wonder what's taking so long.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:36.630
Hello?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.120
Hinata, did you find her?

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.590
It's not good, Chief. Marimo-neesan is...

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:43.920
What?!

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.060
Okay.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.610
What should I do?

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:52.330
Should I call the police?

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:58.180
Chief, hello. Are you there?

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.660
Chief!? Chief!?

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.470
Oh crap, that was a mistake.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.810
Hello?

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.700
Haruka?

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.410
Oh Hinata, it's you.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.730
What? Marimo-chan did?

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.350
Roger.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:24.510
Don't worry. She just left, so if I run,

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.350
I can catch up to her.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.980
Then I'll leave the Chief to you.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.890
All right...

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.970
Hina-chan, she's not here!

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.480
Well, Marimo-san is actually...

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.530
No, I'm not talking about
her. It's the kitten!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:48.720
Marimo-san had this little kitten
that was her friend,

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.070
and it's not here!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:52.360
I don't know where she went!

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:57.130
Yume, can you just go back
to the house for now?

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.310
Huh? Why?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.860
Okay.  Okay.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.380
Now the Chief's gone?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.940
All right, I'll meet up with Yuuki
and get back right away.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.460
Oh!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.360
I forgot to tell her that Marimo-chan's
scarf was here.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:31.540
The Chief's actually quite a fast runner...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.690
Saki-chan!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:27.550
I was so worried. Haru-chan just told me...

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.000
You're crushing me...

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.650
Oh, sorry.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.560
Idiot.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:38.780
I was worried about you.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.580
The Chief said that?

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:04.870
That's right.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:08.860
Normally, Chief is never really honest, but she just
came right out and said, "I was worried about you."

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.840
The Chief was so dreamy
when she was like that.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.620
Haruka, pay cut.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.520
Pay cut

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.620
You were listening, Chief?

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:29.750
What's the big deal? You shouldn't
be so embarrassed about it.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.260
I'm cutting your pay too, Hinata.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.050
What are you talking about?!

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:36.770
While I'm at it, I'm cutting everyone's pay!

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:39.910
Pay cut! Pay cuts all around!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.800
Huh!?

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.060
I got a pay cut...

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.720
It's awful, isn't it.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.370
Tell me about it.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:12.540
Let's toast to Kana's first pay cut
with some cola.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:21.050
It sounds like this Marimo-san
was really something though.

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.150
What do you mean?

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:26.610
Well she can use magic to make the
Chief act all nice and gentle.

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:31.680
Haha, magic. That's a good one.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:35.000
I wish I knew that magic.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:39.930
Then, whenever I wanted,
wherever I wanted,

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.610
I could make Chief all nice and
gentle and then we'd...

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.710
Hey, Haruharu!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.120
Come back.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:50.780
But if she wasn't using magic,

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.930
I wonder why Chief was always
so nice around Marimo-san.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:59.060
I guess she just had something
that we don't have.

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.510
Something, you say?

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.900
Yep.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.300
What do you think it was, Kana-chan?

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:06.260
Huh?

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:09.100
That's true...

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.380
Oh! It's that she put her
scarf around the cat!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.400
Huh?

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:17.450
I bet Marimo-san is really nice!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.780
I see.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:24.880
But then again, you're all very nice too.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.360
I guess I don't know the reason.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:37.520
But that was really a rare thing.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:41.590
Yeah, you don't get to see the
Chief like that every day.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:43.010
That's not what I mean!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.100
Huh?

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.720
I'm talking about Marimo-chan
going to pick up the Chief!

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.640
Oh yeah.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.880
Marimo-neesan, who always got lost,

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.510
picked someone up for the first time!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.590
Nope.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:02.110
Marimo-san "graduated" right after that,

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:04.610
so the first time she did
it was also the last.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.180
She graduated?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:15.130
But it was good for Marimo-chan
that she didn't end up having to

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.950
be picked up after her very last run.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:23.670
But, wasn't that the Chief actually
going out to pick her up?

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:24.650
What?

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.640
No, she wasn't!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.620
Yes, she was!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:37.610
Graduation, huh.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:13.810
You're still up?

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:17.380
Oh, I was just getting something to drink.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:20.300
You too?

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.240
Why are you staring at me?

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.290
It's nothing!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.340
What?

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:34.870
Umm...

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.890
aren't you lonely?

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.180
Why?

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:44.310
Because Marimo-san graduated
and moved on from here.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:48.310
She was a pain, so I just got
rid of a burden, really.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:51.380
But I thought you...

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.420
Err, I mean...

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:59.010
I mean, I was just thinking
it would be so sad

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.920
if I ever had to leave you all.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:08.340
The time will come when
you'll leave here, too.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.690
Oh I see. That time will come for me too...

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.310
Don't worry about it, just go to bed.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.090
You only have two hours left to sleep!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.420
You're right!

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.900
Goodnight!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.840
Sheesh.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.220
It's the kitten from Tenjin-san.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.250
Yeah.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:46.240
She wasn't in the usual spot
so I had to look all over.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.080
That's my line.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:52.570
I guess so, huh!

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:01.280
You're leaving tomorrow, right?

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.140
Yes.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.690
Did you clean your room properly?

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.370
Yes.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:12.570
Uhm, Saki-chan?

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:13.620
The kitten...

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:14.270
Huh?

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:17.250
It found this place by itself, right?

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.870
Yes.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:44.860
My First Diet

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:32.700
Next time, "My First Diet"

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:34.740
Totally sweet creamy pasta.

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:36.430
A pretty girl hitting a drum set.

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:38.860
The most ridiculously sweet creamy pasta.

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.480
A pretty girl rolling the drum set.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.410
Terrific sweet creamy pasta
that even Jordan likes.

00:23:43.410 --> 00:23:44.860
Who's Jordan?
